  "description": "Jeong-Cheol is a gambler, a failure, and now a divorcé after ten years of a marriage that finally collapsed. Before he can even catch his breath or curse his miserable luck, the very person who started it all returns to his life. Ji Min-Yeong, the ex-lover who terrified him, chased him, and yet was the one he loved more deeply than anyone else, appears without warning. Standing before him with the same chilling certainty as in the past, Min-Yeong whispers the words Jeong-Cheol fears most:\n\n*“I will stay with you until the moment you die, Cheol.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
